OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with variable
OL,8,Famounts of cloud. Becoming chilly in
OL,9,Fsome sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FEarly brightness in the
OL,12,Fnorth otherwise a largely dry day but
OL,13,Fbecoming cloudy. Rain spreading
OL,14,Fnortheast in the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FOvernight rain and Thursday and Friday
OL,18,Fsoon clearing then dry and bright. Dry
OL,19,Fwith bright spells on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
